# Content model

Public site is **not** assembled from the page-component tree. Typed entities:

| Entity | Role |
|---|---|
| `ingest_items` | Raw imported sources (stage 1+); not public |
| `posts` | All public content after materialize (work + invitations) |
| `events` | Legacy admin table only; public site uses invitation posts |
| `appearances` | Press / v tisku |

## Sections (provisional — taxonomy may change after keyword corpus)

| Code | Czech | Path | Entity |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ritualy` | Svatební rituály | `/svatebni-ritualy` | lasting posts |
| `himmelhaus` | Himmelhaus | `/himmelhaus` | lasting posts |
| `umeni` | Umění | `/umeni` | lasting posts |
| `udalosti` | Události | `/udalosti` | invitation posts (`isInvitation`) |

Himmelhaus is the house; Instagram handle is `@himmlhaus`.

`Section::work()` is the three lasting sections. `Section::all()` includes Události.

## Homepage

Visual layout is in `homepage.mdc`. Text is the next **current invitation** post, else the latest lasting work post. The five hero photos are still partly mock (invitation cover as lead). Then three work-section plots (not Události).

## Invitations

Materialized as posts with `isInvitation`, `startsAt` / `endsAt` / `place`, section `udalosti`. Public only while current (effective end ≥ now); expired → hidden everywhere including detail **404**. Listing `/udalosti` is current invites only (no archive). Admin legacy **Události** (`events` table) remains until migrated.

## Post parts (`layoutJson.parts`)

Public post/invitation body is an ordered list in `posts.layoutJson.parts`:

| type | fields | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `text` | `html` | Sanitized HTML chunk |
| `image` | `postFileId` | One selected photo |
| `gallery` | `postFileIds` | Ordered photos |

- **`post_files`**: only photos included in the post (subset of ingest), ordered; rating/role/demote kept. Demoted/skip never enter.
- Parts reference **`postFileId`**, not ingest ids.
- **`bodyHtml` / `excerpt`**: derived — excerpt from first text part; bodyHtml = concat of text parts (search/admin fallback).
- Built by `PostMaterializer` via Gemini (`PostLayoutPlanner`): `excerpt` is for cards/listings only; body `parts` hold the complete copy (including opening lines). LLM curates photos (not all required), groups related ones into galleries, interleaves short text beats. Invitation detail is one continuous block (header + parts), not a split hero.
- Edited in admin post form. See `App\Classes\Content\PostParts`.

## Import

Load into ingest via Katu jobs first (see `ingest.mdc`). Public `posts` come from `MaterializePosts`, not refresh jobs.
